      <div class="sd-eyebrow">Who holds the space</div>
      <blockquote class="sd-lineage-pullquote">
        I'm not here to heal you. I'm here to hold the space while <em>you</em> do.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="sd-lineage-body">
        Songdance is the work of <strong>Jacob Vermeulen</strong> — pianist, singer, and
        educator who spent nearly twenty years on the voice before this practice found its
        shape.
      </p>
      <p class="sd-lineage-body">
        He doesn't call himself a healer. His work is to make a room safe enough that the
        true sound can come — and to trust what it does.
      </p>
